  "details": "While an instance has a hype train ongoing and the VRChat Pride Campaign 2026 hype train 5 minute timer is being renewed continuously refreshed with more VRC+ gift drops every ~4 minutes, the hype train icon doesn't show up reliably in the instance details or instance list for a world.\n\nAs a theoretical example, a hype train might be visible 20/100 for one moment in the instance list, then the hype train count may disappear for a few minutes from the world instance when refreshed, and then be 21/100 in the instance list again when refreshed again.\n\nThe updates are also quite delayed, it could take ~3 minutes from the start of a hype train to even see a hype train indicator in the world list.",
